  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the implementation and further strengthening of Turkey&#x2019;s National Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration mechanism (N-AVRR) &#x2013; PILLAR 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to contribute to voluntary, dignified and sustainable return of irregular migrants from Turkey to main countries of origin, through support for the operationalization and further strengthening of the newly established national assisted voluntary return mechanism in Turkey.</narrative>
  </description>
